<title>USA: Mercury lowers Pegasus Gold stake.</title>
<headline>Mercury lowers Pegasus Gold stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British investment adviser Mercury Asset Management Plc Wednesday said it lowered its stake in Pegasus Gold Inc  5.09 percent or 2.1 million common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 417,000 shares of Pegasus between June 25 and July 17 at prices ranging from $5.3873 to $6.19 a share.</p>
<p>Mercury is a subsidiary of Mercury Asset Management Group Plc.</p>
